pgrade purchased while it remains at medium range.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":1},{"key":"ALTERBASIC","data":{"Key":"ALTERBASIC","Name":"Alter Basic Power","Description":"The Force user can tap into the Living Force of their surroundings, manipulating the nearby environs.\n[P]The Force user may spend [FP] to make all terrain currently within short range difficult terrain until the end of their next turn.\n[P]The Force user may spend [FP] to make all terrain currently within short range normal terrain until the end of their next turn.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":1},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL2","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL2","Name":"Control: Concealment","Description":"The Force user may spend [FP] to give all characters within short range of the user concealment.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":1},{"key":"CONJURENUMBER","data":{"Key":"CONJURENUMBER","Name":"Number","Description":"Spend [FP][FP] to create additional, identical conjurations equal to ranks in Number upgrade purchased.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"CONJUREMAGNITUDE","data":{"Key":"CONJUREMAGNITUDE","Name":"Magnitude","Description":"Spend [FP] to increase the maximum encumbrance of the facsimile that can be conjured by 2 per Magnitude upgrade purchased.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"CONJURECONTROL1","data":{"Key":"CONJURECONTROL1","Name":"Control: Defensive, Deflection, Stun","Description":"Spend [FP] to add 1 of the following weapon qualities to the conjuration: Defensive 1, Deflection 1, Stun 4.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"CONJURECONTROL2","data":{"Key":"CONJURECONTROL2","Name":"Control: Burn, Pierce, Vicious","Description":"Spend [FP] to add 1 of the following weapon qualities to the conjuration: Burn 3, Pierce 3, Vicious 3.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"CONJURERANGE","data":{"Key":"CONJURERANGE","Name":"Range","Description":"Spend [FP] to increase the range at which the facsimile can be conjured and sustained by 1 (to a maximum of extreme).","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"CONJUREMASTERY","data":{"Key":"CONJUREMASTERY","Name":"Mastery","Description":"Spend [FP][FP][FP] to summon the facsimile of a creature of silhouette 1 or smaller instead of an object. This creature is bound to the user's will, and mindlessly follows that character's commands until the end of the Force user's next turn. If the user has the corpse of the creature being conjured to imbue with false life, this facsimile lasts until the end of the encounter instead, but the user gains 7 conflict for doing so.","Source":{"_Page":"40","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Conjure"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL1","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL1","Name":"Control: Supplies","Description":"Spend [FP] and make an [B]Average ([DI][DI]) Survival check[b] to instantly discover food, water, or other critical supplies within extreme range.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERRANGE","data":{"Key":"ALTERRANGE","Name":"Range","Description":"Spend [FP][FP] to increase power's range by a number of range bands equal to Range upgrades purchased.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL3","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL3","Name":"Control: Animals","Description":"Spend [FP] to share the senses of animals within range of this power, adding [BO] to Perception and Vigilance checks, and gaining other benefits.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL4","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL4","Name":"Control: Firm Terrain","Description":"The power can affect firm terrain, such as packed earth, stone, or ice.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERDURATION","data":{"Key":"ALTERDURATION","Name":"Duration","Description":"Commit [FO] after successfully activating the power to sustain its effects while the user remains within range of the affected area.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERSTRENGTH","data":{"Key":"ALTERSTRENGTH","Name":"Strength","Description":"Spend [FP] to allow a number of targets equal to the number of Strength upgrades to ignore this power's effects.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL5","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL5","Name":"Control: Impassible","Description":"Spend [FP][FP] to make a small patch of terrain within the affected area impassible.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL6","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL6","Name":"Control: Corrosive","Description":"Spend [FP][FP] to create a corrosive atmosphere in a small area within the effected area.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERCONTROL7","data":{"Key":"ALTERCONTROL7","Name":"Control: Upgrade","Description":"Spend [FP][FP] to upgrade to difficulty of all checks made by opponents while in the power's area of effect once.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0},{"key":"ALTERMASTERY","data":{"Key":"ALTERMASTERY","Name":"Mastery","Description":"When the user activates this power without spending [FP] generated from [DA] results, add [LI] to all other Force power checks made within this power's area of effect.\n[P]When the user activates this power without spending [FP] generated from [LI] results, add [DA] to all other Force power checks made within this power's area of effect.","Source":{"_Page":"43","__text":"Unlimited Power"},"Custom":"AddedItem","Power":"Alter"},"count":0}],"BoughtTalents":[{"key":"IRONBODY","data":{"Key":"IRONBODY","Name":"Iron Body","Description":"Remove [SE] per rank of Iron Body from Coordination and Resilience checks. Reduce the critical rating of unarmed attacks by 1 per rank of Iron Body (to a minimum of 1).","Source":{"_Page":"34","__text":"No Disintegrations"},"Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","ItemChanges":[{"CritChange":"-1","ItemKey":"UNARMED"}],"DieModifiers":[{"SkillKey":"COORD","SetbackCount":"1"},{"SkillKey":"RESIL","SetbackCount":"1"}]},"count":1},{"key":"TOUGH","data":{"Key":"TOUGH","Name":"Toughened","Description":"Gain +2 wound threshold.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","Attributes":{"WoundThreshold":"2"}},"count":2},{"key":"PRECSTR","data":{"Key":"PRECSTR","Name":"Precision Strike","Description":"When this character inflicts a Critical Injury with a Brawl, Melee, or Lightsaber weapon, may suffer 1 strain to change the result to any [B]Easy ([DI])[b] Critical Injury result.","ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"OOT Incidental","Source":[{"_Page":"31","__text":"Keeping the Peace"},{"_Page":"35","__text":"No Disintegrations"}]},"count":1},{"key":"PARRY","data":{"Key":"PARRY","Name":"Parry","Description":"When hit by a melee attack, suffer 3 strain to reduce damage by 2 plus ranks in Parry.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"OOT Incidental","Source":[{"_Page":"149","__text":"Force and Destiny Core Rulebook"},{"_Page":"35","__text":"No Disintegrations"}]},"count":1},{"key":"PRECSTRIMP","data":{"Key":"PRECSTRIMP","Name":"Precision Strike (Improved)","Description":"Once per round, when inflicting a Critical Injury with a Brawl or Melee weapon, may suffer 2 strain to change the result to any [B]Average ([DI][DI])[b] Critical injury.","ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"OOT Incidental","Source":{"_Page":"35","__text":"No Disintegrations"}},"count":1},{"key":"GRIT","data":{"Key":"GRIT","Name":"Grit","Description":"Gain +1 strain threshold","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","Attributes":{"StrainThreshold":"1"}},"count":1},{"key":"DEDI","data":{"Key":"DEDI","Name":"Dedication","Description":"Gain +1 to a single characteristic. This cannot bring a characteristic above 6.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","CharacteristicChoices":{"CharacteristicChoice":{"Bonus":"1"}}},"count":1},{"key":"ARM","data":{"Key":"ARM","Name":"Armor Master","Description":"When wearing armor, Increase total soak value by 1.","ActivationValue":"Passive","Attributes":{"SoakValue":"1","Requirement":{"WearingArmor":"true"}}},"count":1},{"key":"SIDESTEP","data":{"Key":"SIDESTEP","Name":"Side Step","Description":"Once per round, may perform Side Step maneuver and suffer a number of strain to upgrade difficulty of all incoming ranged attacks by an equal number for the next round. Strain suffered this way cannot exceed ranks in Side Step.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Active"},"count":1},{"key":"MARTIALGRACE","data":{"Key":"MARTIALGRACE","Name":"Martial Grace","Description":"Once per round, suffers 2 strain to add damage equal to ranks in Coordination to next Brawl check made this turn.","Source":{"_Page":"35","__text":"No Disintegrations"},"ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"Incidental"},"count":0},{"key":"ACKLAYSCST","data":{"Key":"ACKLAYSCST","Name":"Acklay's Scything Strike","Description":"Brawl attacks gain Pierce equal to Force rating.","ActivationValue":"Passive","ItemChanges":[{"QualityChanges":[{"UseForceRating":"true","Key":"PIERCE"}],"SkillKey":"BRAWL","AddQuality":"true"}],"ForceTalent":"true","Source":{"_Page":"30","__text":"Knights of Fate"}},"count":0},{"key":"UNARMPARRY","data":{"Key":"UNARMPARRY","Name":"Unarmed Parry","Description":"May Parry while unarmed Reduce strain cost to Parry while unarmed by 1 (to a minimum of 1).","ActivationValue":"Passive","Source":{"_Page":"36","__text":"No Disintegrations"}},"count":0},{"key":"DODGE","data":{"Key":"DODGE","Name":"Dodge","Description":"When targeted by combat check, may perform a Dodge incidental to suffer a number of strain no greater than ranks of Dodge, then upgrade the difficulty of the check by that number.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Active"},"count":0},{"key":"SWIFT","data":{"Key":"SWIFT","Name":"Swift","Description":"Do not suffer usual penalties for moving through difficult terrain.","ActivationValue":"Passive"},"count":0},{"key":"DODGEIMP","data":{"Key":"DODGEIMP","Name":"Dodge (Improved)","Description":"After using Dodge, can make a Move maneuver as an out-of-turn incidental.","ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"Incidental","Source":{"_Page":"30","__text":"Knights of Fate"}},"count":0},{"key":"SAPITHSUND","data":{"Key":"SAPITHSUND","Name":"Sapith Sundering","Description":"May add [FO] up to Force rating to Brawl checks; the attack gains the Sunder quality, and character may spend [FP] generated one the check as [AD] to activate the Sunder quality.","Source":{"_Page":"31","__text":"Knights of Fate"},"ActivationValue":"Active","ForceTalent":"true","Activation":"Incidental"},"count":0},{"key":"FORCERAT","data":{"Key":"FORCERAT","Name":"Force Rating","Description":"Gain +1 Force Rating.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","Attributes":{"ForceRating":"1"},"ForceTalent":"true"},"count":0},{"key":"FARSTRIKE","data":{"Key":"FARSTRIKE","Name":"Far Strike","Description":"As an action, make a Brawl check as a ranged attack, adding [FO] up to Force rating, increase the range of the attack by one band for each [FP] spent, to a maximum of long.","Source":{"_Page":"30","__text":"Knights of Fate"},"ActivationValue":"Active","ForceTalent":"true","Activation":"Action"},"count":0},{"key":"INTIM","data":{"Key":"INTIM","Name":"Intimidating","Description":"May suffer a number of strain to downgrade difficulty of Coercion checks, or upgrade difficulty when targeted by Coercion checks, by an equal number. Strain suffered this way cannot exceed ranks in Intimidating.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Active"},"count":0},{"key":"CONDITIONED","data":{"Key":"CONDITIONED","Name":"Conditioned","Description":"Remove [SE] per rank of Conditioned from Athletics and Coordination check. Reduce the damage and strain suffered from falling by 1 per rank of Conditioned.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive","DieModifiers":[{"SkillKey":"ATHL","SetbackCount":"1"},{"SkillKey":"COORD","SetbackCount":"1"}],"Source":[{"_Page":"141","__text":"Force and Destiny Core Rulebook"},{"_Page":"34","__text":"Forged in Battle"}]},"count":0},{"key":"JUMP","data":{"Key":"JUMP","Name":"Jump Up","Description":"Once per round, may stand from seated or prone as an incidental.","ActivationValue":"Active"},"count":0},{"key":"JETPACKECOTR","data":{"Key":"JETPACKECOTR","Name":"Jetpack Expertise","Description":"The character may spend [AD] from their checks to remove 1 system strain from their jetpack. (They may choose this effect multiple times when spending [AD])","Source":"Collapse of the Republic","ActivationValue":"Active","Activation":"Incidental"},"count":0},{"key":"POINTBL","data":{"Key":"POINTBL","Name":"Point Blank","Description":"Add 1 damage per rank of Point Blank to damage of one hit of successful attack while using Ranged (Heavy) or Ranged (Light) skills at short range or engaged.","Ranked":"true","ActivationValue":"Passive"},"count":0},{"key":"ARMIMP","data":{"Key":"ARMIMP","Name":"Armor Master (Improved)","Description":"When wearing armor with a soak value of 2 or higher, increase defense by 1.","ActivationValue":"Passive","Attributes":{"Defen